Date:   Sat Sep 5 18:48:18 2026 +0800

    fix(sfcc-92): accessibility fixes — screen reader, max qty announcement, size constant

    - Add aria-label to ZimmButton label variant so VoiceOver reads
      text-transform:uppercase as words rather than spelling acronyms
    - Add ariaDescribedBy prop to ZimmButton; wire max-order-qty message
      to Add to Bag button so keyboard users hear the reason on focus
    - Add role="alert" to max-order-qty messages so they are announced
      immediately when they appear without requiring focus
    - Extract SFCC_SIZE_ATTRIBUTE_ID constant; replace all raw 'size'
      string comparisons across product-view (CR finding)
    - Restore Find your size beside size selector on desktop with
      sizeGuide variant and growUnderline animation

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

